{"id":"150182b44c47c043","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md","title":"ZFC Inner3 Transitive Class Model","display":"df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model — ZFC Inner3 Transitive Class Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model"],"display":"df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model — ZFC Inner3 Transitive Class Model","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model — ZFC Inner3 Transitive Class Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (class parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (the ambient ZFC theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> (transitive definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi\">\\((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi\\)</span> (the class-satisfaction schema of the ambient two-sorted class metatheory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-class-satisfaction</code> 的有限公式递归；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> 中每个成员是该纯成员语言的句子，初始赋值取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{Ord}\\subseteq M\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,\\varnothing)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{Ord}\\subseteq M\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,\\varnothing)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is a transitive definable class containing all ordinals whose inherited class structure satisfies every axiom of ZFC.</li>\n<li>The satisfaction clause is explicitly schematic in the ambient two-sorted class metatheory; it is not the set-coded satisfaction predicate applied outside its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZFC}$ (the ambient ZFC theory, see [[58-ax-zfc]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S$ (transitive definable-class predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{Cls}}\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner3\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}class\\text{-}model} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land \\operatorname{Ord}\\subseteq M\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ZFC}\\;\\mathrm{ClassSat}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(M,\\varphi,\\varnothing)","display":true}],"bytes":1741,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0244462250ae67e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (含所有序数的传递 ZFC 类模型谓词, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]])"},{"id":"5e5e9d27f0e20f58","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]])"},{"id":"cd4cd5d7f9d5cf46","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ is the transitive class-model predicate from [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md]]."},{"id":"c83b656624a2acb7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcInner3TransitiveClassModel}_S$ (exact transitive ZFC class-model predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-model.md|58-df-zfc-inner3-transitive-class-mode